# 4. Incremental Evolution: Extending the CLI Later

Tomorrow, if the agent needs to fulfill an order, it doesn't rewrite the `shopify` CLI from scratch. It calls **`ctx.cli.extend`**:

```typescript
await ctx.cli.extend("shopify", "orders fulfill", `
  if (subcommand === "orders fulfill") {
    const orderId = flags["id"];
    const tracking = flags["tracking"];
    const res = await ctx.vault.fetchWithAuth(
      \`https://\${storeDomain}/admin/api/2026-07/orders/\${orderId}/fulfillments.json\`,
      {
        credentialName: "SHOPIFY_ADMIN_TOKEN",
        method: "POST",
        body: JSON.stringify({ fulfillment: { tracking_number: tracking } })
      }
    );
    return "✔ Order " + orderId + " fulfilled with tracking " + tracking;
  }
`);
```

